WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Slow motion: the takeaway, club head low and wide.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.500
At the top the left arm stays long and the hips have already started back.

00:08.500 --> 00:13.000
Impact. Hands ahead of the ball, weight on the lead side.

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
The finish tells you everything: balanced, chest to the target.
